1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,260
But the ones nobody sees are the ones I wear the most

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:07,860
That everyday kinda hurting that I never let show

3
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:11,620
I smile so they won't worry, and I laugh so they won't cry

4
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:15,220
There's a scar behind the smile that you won't catch with the naked eye

5
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:18,900
So if you're smiling through it too, I know that look you wear

6
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:22,580
You don't have to say a word, I can see that it's there

7
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:26,500
And you don't have to fake it, not with me, not here tonight

8
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,020
We can both put the smile down for a minute, and that's alright

9
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:33,780
Maybe yours came from a surgeon, maybe yours came from a fall

10
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:37,460
Maybe yours came from the ones who should have loved you most of all

11
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:41,140
Maybe yours are on the inside where no doctor's ever been

12
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:44,820
It don't matter where you got 'em, you're allowed to heal again

13
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:45,720
You don't owe the hurt your future, and you don't owe it another day
